# repo-quality-analyzer — environment template.
#
# No environment configuration is required to run the tool.
# Analysis is fully local: the LLM API key (bring-your-own-key) is entered
# in the web UI and stored only in your browser's localStorage — never on
# the server. Reports are persisted to db/analysis-results/ automatically.
#
# This file exists so that `cp .env.example .env` (or a fresh clone) has a
# safe default; it contains no secrets.
